          "_name": "clients2",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"clients2\" group=\"Clients\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"BG\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>4</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/untitled-design-3.png\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#07294b\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .card-box\"><p><b>Định dạng phong phú,&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-size: 2.2rem;\">đa dạng phong cách học tập</b></p></h4>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            \n            \n            <div class=\"item features-without-image mb-5 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/social-2-removebg-preview-1.png\" alt data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                         Our Clients\n                        </h6>\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Chỉ âm thanh</b></h5>\n                          <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Giúp việc học trở nên dễ dàng khi di chuyển</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image mb-5 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/social-removebg-preview-2.png\" alt=\"Đăng tuyển liên tục LinkedIn\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                         Our Clients\n                        </h6>\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Live trực tuyến</b></h5>\n                          <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Tổ chức bởi giảng viên và chuyên gia trong ngành</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image mb-5 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/1.png\" alt data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            Our Clients\n                        </h6>\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Video ngắn</b></h5>\n      \n                          <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Dành cho người học thích nội dung ngắn gọn<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image mb-5 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/2.png\" alt data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            Our Clients\n                        </h6>\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Đa phương tiện</b></h5>\n                          <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Bao gồm văn bản, nội dung và đồ họa</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"../_images/hightlights/4.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" class=\"img-nano\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-8\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h3 class=\"aligncontent1 mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                        <b>Nano-learning</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\" aligncontent1 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Chương trình thu hút mọi thế hệ người học, tối ưu trên nền tảng di động<br><br>Bao gồm các kỹ năng tập trung vào các kỹ năng quan trọng cho các chuyên gia trong môi trường doanh nghiệp.<br><br>Nội dung về các chủ đề như Lãnh đạo và Quản lý, Phát triển Chuyên môn và Công cụ Phần mềm, chẳng hạn như:<br></p>\n                    <ul class=\"aligncontent1 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                      <li>Mẹo Nano sử dụng ChatGPT cho Kinh doanh</li>\n                      <li>Giao tiếp như một Nhà lãnh đạo</li>\n                      <li>Mẹo Nano sử dụng Microsoft Office</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn d-flex justify-content-center\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"index.html#li-form\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Đăng ký tư vấn</a></div>\n\n\n    </div>\n</section>",
